<p class="hf-q"><code>[assert:certifications]</code> 1.7 What third-party security certifications do you hold (SOC 2, ISO 27001, FedRAMP)? Assert FULL, PARTIAL, or NON-COMPLIANT for each. "Not verifiable" is not a valid compliance status.</p>

</section>

