<p class="hf-q"><code>[assert:monitoring_categories]</code> 4.1 Describe your security monitoring infrastructure. Assert the categories of events collected. "Monitoring exists" without naming categories is NON-RESPONSIVE.</p>

<p class="hf-q"><code>[assert:anomaly_detection]</code> 4.2 What is your process for detecting and responding to anomalous behavior? Assert the detection method by name.</p>

